      "tag": "Ask",
      "h2": "Asking the Time",
      "body_html": "<p>To ask, say: <strong>Quelle heure est-il?</strong> = What time is it? Reply with <strong>Il est ___ heure(s)</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Hours",
      "h2": "On the Hour",
      "body_html": "<p>'It's 3 o'clock' = <strong>Il est trois heures</strong>. After 1 it's plural — 'heures'. At 1 it's <strong>il est une heure</strong>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Half",
      "h2": "Half Past & Quarter",
      "body_html": "<p>'It's half past 4' = <strong>Il est quatre heures et demie</strong>. 'Quarter past 4' = et quart. 'Quarter to 5' = cinq heures moins le quart.</p>"
    }
  ],
